	"data": "Project: Rescue Narrative (Fiction)\n\nWhat It Is\ncithoreal's primary ongoing fiction project — a fantasy narrative featuring a character named Rescue. Exists in two interconnected forms: the Fog Story (written fiction, detailed in OneNote) and the VR Experience (described in Brain Extensions.docx, Dec 2019). Both are about entering a space that forces you to confront yourself.\n\nFor the full deep-dive article, see: [[concepts/the-rescue-experience]]\n\nEvidence Across Eras\n\n2023–2024 H1\nMultiple…",
